 "remarks": "Located on the brim of vibrant downtown Stamford and in the heart of the popular Fairgate community, this newer townhome is bright, cheerful and move-in ready! This private end-unit with it's own entrance feels like your own home! Inside you'll find a designer kitchen with cool new granite countertops, opening to the bright + sunny window-lined living + dining areas featuring new laminate flooring + fresh paint. This townhome is tucked into the Fairgate community on a tree-lined street with sidewalks, features professional landscaping, on-site management + 24-hour security. Residents enjoy a meticulously maintained, pet-friendly environment - and - BONUS - access to popular Fairgate organic Farm! Central A/C, economical gas heat, 5-star energy rated appliances And NO ADDITIONAL FEES, put this townhouse on your \"must see\" list! Applicants must complete the Fairgate application uploaded in supplements and credit check through Applyconnect only.",
